# Copy to .dev.vars (gitignored) for local dev. Read automatically by
# @cloudflare/vite-plugin (Wrangler's unstable_getVarsForDev) - no
# vite.config.ts changes needed.
#
# This is the OPERATOR hot key - worker/chain.ts uses it to sign
# EscrowVault.withdraw() calls. Keep it separate from the vault's owner/
# deployer key (contracts/.env.example) - operator can only ever call
# `withdraw`, owner can pause/rotate it.
#
# For LOCAL testing only, any Hardhat default test account's private key is
# fine (public, well-known, zero real value - e.g. the first `npx hardhat
# node` account). For a real network, generate a fresh key yourself and
# fund it - this app never generates or sees a real-value private key.
OPERATOR_PRIVATE_KEY=
